    {
      "heading": "More room inside gold",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "guoqin gu moves from 16th to 13th on the ARC-AGI-2 public board, adding 1.81 points against the midnight baseline to reach 69.31. The advance improves an existing place in the provisional gold band. The closing gold threshold rises from 67.50 to 68.06, leaving guoqin gu 1.25 points above it. ARC Raiders slips from 14th to 15th at an unchanged 68.75, illustrating the pressure on teams near that boundary."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The leaders hold",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs keeps first at 88.06, followed by Yi-Chia Chen at 84.72 and nvbanana at 81.39. Their scores and ranks are unchanged against the edition’s baseline. nvbanana retains a 0.56-point lead over fourth-placed rabbithole. These are public standings, not final medals; the private leaderboard determines the awards."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movement through the field",
