        "wire-2026-10-24-0403-arc-2-renxiaohan-climbs-to-thirty-third"
      ],
      "text": "David Cao gains 3.19 points to reach 35.97 and rises from 151st to 89th against the midnight comparison. yukichi0403 adds 1.11 to reach 39.86 and moves from 70th to 67th. The overnight feed also records Yuvraj #2 advancing from 47.08 to 54.03; the wire’s rolling-day comparison put that entry 39th. Earlier wire windows reported Bao Loc Pham reaching 22nd at 63.61, Lee Minseung reaching 27th at 59.58 and renxiaohan reaching 33rd at 56.94. Those are dated wire observations, not additional gains or closing ranks assigned by this edition."
